@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "ContentManagementPage / contentApi" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "ContentVersionsController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "ContentVersionService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "ContentVersionRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "ContentVersion" as P4 <<entity>>
P0 -> P1: Request draft validation
P1 -> P2: Check draft conditions
P2 -> P3: Load version and snapshot
P3 --> P2: Return the snapshot
note over P2,P4: Require Draft and current revision; validate and hash the snapshot.
P2 -> P4: Record validation results
P2 -> P3: Save the new revision
P2 --> P1: Return validation results
P1 --> P0: Display validation results
alt isValid and user submits the same revision
P0 -> P1: Submit the draft
P1 -> P2: Check submission guards
note over P2,P4: Recheck the validated snapshot and current revision before submission.
P2 -> P4: Mark as awaiting review
P2 -> P3: Save the new revision
P2 --> P1: Return version details
P1 --> P0: Display review status
else validation failed or revision changed
note over P0,P4: Show the validation or conflict explanation and keep the draft unchanged.
end
@enduml